    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Capture the fear. Earn the views.&quot;</strong><br><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842550/extras/e15408a9e80459635123a10a2ead68cf.poster.avif?t=1752764464\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842550/extras/e15408a9e80459635123a10a2ead68cf.webm?t=1752764464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842550/extras/e15408a9e80459635123a10a2ead68cf.mp4?t=1752764464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a livestreamer exploring a snow-covered forest, your goal is to document supernatural phenomena on camera.<br>Manage your <strong>stamina, hunger, and desire for validation</strong>, and push your limits in search of the perfect shot.<br>Gain followers, grow your channel, and uncover the hidden truth buried in the snow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Features\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 <strong>Capture supernatural events and turn them into views</strong><br>Play from a first-person perspective and film ghostly phenomena.<br><strong>Your shooting precision and distance affect the evaluation</strong>, and more views are earned with higher quality footage.<br><strong>Longer recordings and closer encounters yield greater rewards</strong>, but also increase the danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udecc <strong>A safe cabin and growth loop</strong><br>Between excursions, return to your mountain cabin to <strong>rest, upload videos, buy items</strong>, and prepare for the next stream.<br>As your subscriber count grows, you\u2019ll gain advantages in future sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Survival through resource management</strong><br>Balance three key stats: <strong>Stamina</strong>, <strong>Validation (Motivation)</strong>, and <strong>Hunger</strong>.<br>If stamina drops to zero, it\u2019s game over. Letting hunger or motivation drop too low will accelerate stamina loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf28\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic weather and cold</strong><br>The weather alternates between normal and snowstorm conditions.<br>Blizzards increase difficulty but also raise the chance of rare supernatural events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac <strong>Live chat reactions</strong><br>Viewer comments appear in real-time during your streams, reacting dynamically to your situation.<br>They create an immersive atmosphere and amplify intense moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcfa <strong>A unique horror loop of shooting, streaming, and progression</strong><br>This is not just a haunted hike\u2014<strong>going viral might be your only way to survive</strong>.<br><br>You are free to stream, record, and upload gameplay videos of this game, including monetized content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to share your experience with others!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Capture the fear. Earn the views.&quot;</strong><br><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842550/extras/e15408a9e80459635123a10a2ead68cf.poster.avif?t=1752764464\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842550/extras/e15408a9e80459635123a10a2ead68cf.webm?t=1752764464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842550/extras/e15408a9e80459635123a10a2ead68cf.mp4?t=1752764464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a livestreamer exploring a snow-covered forest, your goal is to document supernatural phenomena on camera.<br>Manage your <strong>stamina, hunger, and desire for validation</strong>, and push your limits in search of the perfect shot.<br>Gain followers, grow your channel, and uncover the hidden truth buried in the snow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Features\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 <strong>Capture supernatural events and turn them into views</strong><br>Play from a first-person perspective and film ghostly phenomena.<br><strong>Your shooting precision and distance affect the evaluation</strong>, and more views are earned with higher quality footage.<br><strong>Longer recordings and closer encounters yield greater rewards</strong>, but also increase the danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udecc <strong>A safe cabin and growth loop</strong><br>Between excursions, return to your mountain cabin to <strong>rest, upload videos, buy items</strong>, and prepare for the next stream.<br>As your subscriber count grows, you\u2019ll gain advantages in future sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Survival through resource management</strong><br>Balance three key stats: <strong>Stamina</strong>, <strong>Validation (Motivation)</strong>, and <strong>Hunger</strong>.<br>If stamina drops to zero, it\u2019s game over. Letting hunger or motivation drop too low will accelerate stamina loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf28\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic weather and cold</strong><br>The weather alternates between normal and snowstorm conditions.<br>Blizzards increase difficulty but also raise the chance of rare supernatural events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac <strong>Live chat reactions</strong><br>Viewer comments appear in real-time during your streams, reacting dynamically to your situation.<br>They create an immersive atmosphere and amplify intense moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcfa <strong>A unique horror loop of shooting, streaming, and progression</strong><br>This is not just a haunted hike\u2014<strong>going viral might be your only way to survive</strong>.<br><br>You are free to stream, record, and upload gameplay videos of this game, including monetized content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to share your experience with others!</p>",
    "short_description": "Play as a livestreamer exploring a snowy forest to capture supernatural events on camera. Manage stamina, hunger, and motivation while risking everything for views. The closer and longer you film, the more you earn. Upload videos, buy gear, and survive in this unique horror survival experience.",
